WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.558
Unit twenty-one. Helmet and Road Safety!

2
00:00:04.508 --> 00:00:08.038
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.088 --> 00:00:11.566
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.616 --> 00:00:15.682
Today we learn about Helmet and Road Safety. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.628 --> 00:00:19.912
Helmet. Say it with me. Helmet!

6
00:00:23.415 --> 00:00:27.298
Motorbike. Say it with me. Motorbike!

7
00:00:30.779 --> 00:00:33.929
Road. Say it with me. Road!

8
00:00:37.436 --> 00:00:40.803
Speed. Say it with me. Speed!

9
00:00:44.302 --> 00:00:47.719
Seatbelt. Say it with me. Seatbelt!

10
00:00:51.204 --> 00:00:54.904
Crossing. Say it with me. Crossing!

11
00:00:58.428 --> 00:01:02.328
Visibility. Say it with me. Visibility!

12
00:01:05.835 --> 00:01:09.252
Law. Say it with me. Law!

13
00:01:12.758 --> 00:01:24.484
Road safety means wearing a helmet on a motorbike and a seatbelt in a car. Use a crossing, follow speed limits, and improve visibility at night. The law is there to protect us.

14
00:01:24.534 --> 00:01:25.933
I can do that too!

15
00:01:27.482 --> 00:01:32.533
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:32.583 --> 00:01:33.733
Road!

17
00:01:34.415 --> 00:01:39.561
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:39.611 --> 00:01:40.761
Visibility!

19
00:01:41.877 --> 00:01:48.305
Did you know? Road traffic injuries are a leading cause of death for young people worldwide!

20
00:01:48.355 --> 00:01:50.216
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:50.909 --> 00:01:58.822
Think and answer. How can you make yourself more visible at night?

22
00:01:58.872 --> 00:02:00.022
Great answer!

23
00:02:01.309 --> 00:02:06.302
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:06.352 --> 00:02:09.060
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

